     "text": [
      "Sentence: a follow-up to xbox is expected to released at the end of this year or the beginning of 2006.\n",
      "Sentence: according to microsoft nine out of 10 xbox live members have played the game for an average of 91 minutes per session.\n",
      "Sentence: but in seven cases customers reported sustaining a minor burn to their hand.\n",
      "Sentence: consumers can order a new cable from the xbox website or by telephoning 0800 028 9276 in the uk.\n",
      "Sentence: halo 2 dropped one place to five while half-life 2 fell to number nine.\n",
      "Sentence: halo 2 has proved popular online with gamers notching up a record 28 million hours playing the game on xbox live.\n",
      "Sentence: halo 2 sells five million copies microsoft is celebrating bumper sales of its xbox sci-fi shooter halo 2. the game has sold more than five million copies worldwide since it went on sale in mid-november the company said.\n",
      "Sentence: it advised users to turn off their xboxes when not in use.\n",
      "Sentence: it affects xboxes made before 23 october 2003 for all regions but mainland europe - and consoles in that region made before 13 january 2004. microsoft said it had received 30 reports of minor injury or property damage due to faulty cables.\n",
      "Sentence: its us launch was on sunday and it goes on sale in japan on 2 december.\n",
      "Sentence: microsoft said customers would get replacement cords within two to four weeks from the time of order.\n",
      "Sentence: nintendo has a 95% share of the handheld gaming market and said it expected to sell around five million of the ds by march 2005.\n",
      "Sentence: on the opening day of the world of warcraft massive multi-player online game more than 200 000 players signed up to play.\n",
      "Sentence: record numbers of warcraft fans are settling in the games online world.\n",
      "Sentence: the company said the move was a preventative step after reports of fire hazard problems with the cables.\n",
      "Sentence: the firm said fewer than one in 10 000 consoles had experienced component failures.\n",
      "Sentence: the online game turns the stand alone warcraft games into a persistent world that players can inhabit not just visit europe s gamers could be waiting until january to hear when they can get their mitts on nintendo s handheld device nintendo ds says gamesindustry.biz.\n",
      "Sentence: the racing game moved up one spot to first place nudging gta: san andreas down to second place.\n",
      "Sentence: the recall affects almost three quarters of all xboxes sold around the world since its launch in 2001. in a statement it added: in almost all instances any damage caused by these failures was contained within the console itself or limited to the tip of the power cord at the back of the console.\n",
      "Sentence: the sequel to the best-selling need for speed: underground has inched ahead of the competition to take the top slot in the official uk games charts.\n",
      "Sentence: we regret the inconvenience but believe offering consumers a free replacement cord is the responsible thing to do.\n",
      "Sentence: xbox power cable fire fear microsoft has said it will replace more than 14 million power cables for its xbox consoles due to safety concerns.\n"
     ]
    }
